{"id":"wb-3-203","name":"淹城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"淹城遗址","text":"淹城遗址位于江苏省常州市武进区湖塘镇淹城行政村。\n\n建于春秋晚期，是中国目前同时期古城遗址中保存最为完整的一座。从里向外，它由子城、子城河、内城、内城河、外城、外城河三城三河相套组成。1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。外有游乐设施。\n\n2017年，淹城遗址景区被评为国家5A级旅游景区。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B7%B9%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93345678,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93345678","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/28fbe86873db69bf688f45e1.jpg","title":"淹城遗址文物碑.jpeg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B7%B9%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E6%96%87%E7%89%A9%E7%A2%91.jpeg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/%E6%B7%B9%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E6%96%87%E7%89%A9%E7%A2%91.jpeg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"章彦博","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​淹城遗址文物碑","width":320,"height":427},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}